+## Renaming / updating a local model
+
+The local layer is not create-and-delete only. `rename.py` edits an entry **in
+place** — the remedy for a slug that a later `git pull` shadowed (a curated entry
+that now ships under your name, core wins the lookup, and your entry is left intact
+but unreachable):
+
+```
+python3 scripts/lib/profiles/rename.py --slug vllm/minimal --new-slug vllm/minimal-mine   # rename to a reachable name
+python3 scripts/lib/profiles/rename.py --slug vllm/minimal-mine --set default_port=20255 # update one field, no demote + re-promote
+python3 scripts/lib/profiles/rename.py --slug a/b --new-slug a/c --set status=experimental  # both
+python3 scripts/lib/profiles/rename.py --slug a/b --new-slug a/c --dry-run               # plan first
+```
+
